# (HELMS fix r3, D73/D76 head steps) T4 seeds of the T5 growth (helm.t5,alloyshape,helmfam-horned): the T5 views with rows 2,3,4 / 2,3 taken out,
# drawn as the gilt frame of the T5 crest (metal 2, no horsehair: no new colours at T4), the base kept on the crown, so T4 reads over T3 and T5 still steps up (head 5 %, OD 0.10); tools: r3/seed.py
view D key rest origin -5 2 when helm.t4,!helm.t5,alloyshape,helmfam-horned replace
